        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the heart of a dark forest, amidst the cold mists, stands an ancient tree - the heart of an ancient curse. You are one of the few groups that decided to unravel the mystery of the forest and complete the ritual that others began many years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hallowed Echo is a cooperative survival horror for 1-4 players that immerses you in a gloomy atmosphere of hunting, stealth and investigation of mysterious anomalies. Build a camp, find weapons, food and tools, fight hunger and cold and try not to attract attention... him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧠 Atmospheric survival horror</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic shadows, flashlight, sounds that make you look around.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger, thirst, fatigue - everything works against you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>👥 Co-op up to 4 players</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's easier to survive together... but the monster hears everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔫 Diverse interaction</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shotgun shooting, map reading, item collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manual reloading, ADS, 4-slot inventory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>👹 Single boss enemy</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't kill him directly. Only weaken and perform a ritual.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔥 Main goal</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy three &quot;cocoons&quot; near the tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set fire to the tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive until it burns down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or get to the Machine and escape the forest.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will be updated with more and more interesting things.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the heart of a dark forest, amidst the cold mists, stands an ancient tree - the heart of an ancient curse. You are one of the few groups that decided to unravel the mystery of the forest and complete the ritual that others began many years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hallowed Echo is a cooperative survival horror for 1-4 players that immerses you in a gloomy atmosphere of hunting, stealth and investigation of mysterious anomalies. Build a camp, find weapons, food and tools, fight hunger and cold and try not to attract attention... him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧠 Atmospheric survival horror</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic shadows, flashlight, sounds that make you look around.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger, thirst, fatigue - everything works against you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>👥 Co-op up to 4 players</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's easier to survive together... but the monster hears everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔫 Diverse interaction</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shotgun shooting, map reading, item collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manual reloading, ADS, 4-slot inventory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>👹 Single boss enemy</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't kill him directly. Only weaken and perform a ritual.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔥 Main goal</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy three &quot;cocoons&quot; near the tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set fire to the tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive until it burns down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or get to the Machine and escape the forest.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will be updated with more and more interesting things.</p>",
